### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Send text-submitted webhook
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/webhooks/text-submitted
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "evt_manual_9001",
  "event_type": "support.form_submitted",
  "source": "form",
  "text": "The FastAPI webhook endpoint works, but I am confused about why the server returns a job ID before the agent result is ready.",
  "user_email": "learner@example.com",
  "metadata": {
    "page": "classroom-demo"
  }
}

### List jobs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/jobs

### Replace job_abc with a real job_id from the webhook response
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/jobs/job_abc
